    <string name="how_to_train_title">How to train</string>
    <string name="how_to_train_body">Sit comfortably and tap Start.\n\nWatch the mind. While there is silence — do nothing. The level rises on its own: each next one lasts twice as long.\n\nAs soon as a thought appears — tap Thought. The session will end, and you will see the level you reached.\n\nThe goal is to stay in silence as long as possible.</string>
